  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 429
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 一道道天雷落在庞大的躯体后化作一道道雷劲在他体内爆开。不过，在雷云中的鲲已经逐渐适应了落雷的强度，身上的伤口甚至开始缓缓愈合。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114530553221805263}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114896722350353090
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1737699451994393}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 442
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 之后雷灵奈何不得对方便被击散了，而那只鲲也注意到了你，目光冰冷的看着你。
